  "description": "The auto-subtitle-generator-online skill transcribes and embeds accurate subtitles into your videos using AI-powered speech recognition. Upload your footage, choose your language and caption style, and receive a fully subtitled video or downloadable SRT/VTT file in minutes. Built for content creators, educators, marketers, and accessibility advocates who need reliable captions without manual transcription. Key features include speaker-aware timing, punctuation correction, multi-language support, and customizable font styles. Supports mp4, mov, avi, webm, and mkv formats.",
